WEB82-029-001,CCOHS WHMIS,标准,国家规范,chemical,4,化学;hazard_communication,How should laboratories implement WHMIS requirements for labels SDS and worker training,How should laboratories implement WHMIS requirements for labels SDS and worker training有哪些要点？,"# WHMIS/GHS/SDS WHMIS is a comprehensive system for providing information on the safe use of hazardous products in Canadian workplaces, via product labels, SDSs ((material) safety data sheets), and worker education and training programs. WHMIS has changed to incorporate the Globally Harmonized System of Classification and Labelling of Chemicals (or GHS) for workplace chemicals. Choose from the following available resources Health and Safety Fact Sheets (OSH Answers) Health and Safety Fact Sheets (OSH Answers) --- [Globally Harmonized System (GHS)](/oshanswers/chemicals/ghs.html) [WHMIS - Confidential Business Information (CBI)](/oshanswers/chemicals/whmis_ghs/cbi.html) [WHMIS - Education and Training ](/oshanswers/chemicals/whmis_ghs/education_training.html) [WHMIS - General ](/oshanswers/chemicals/whmis_ghs/general.html) [WHMIS - Glossary](/oshanswers/chemicals/whmis_ghs/glossary/) [WHMIS - Hazard Classes and Categories ](/oshanswers/chemicals/whmis_ghs/hazard_classes.html) [WHMIS - HCS 2012 Variances](/oshanswers/chemicals/whmis_ghs/variances.html) [WHMIS - Labels ](/oshanswers/chemicals/whmis_ghs/labels.html) [WHMIS - Laboratories](/oshanswers/chemicals/whmis_ghs/laboratories.html) [WHMIS - Pictograms ](/oshanswers/chemicals/whmis_ghs/pictograms.html) [WHMIS - Safety Data Sheet (SDS) ](/oshanswers/chemicals/whmis_ghs/sds.html) I want to... [See what's new](/oshanswers/whats_new.html) [Learn more about OSH Answers](/oshanswers/about.html) [ VIEW ALL FACT SHEETS ](/oshanswers/) Legislation Services Legislation Services For more information or to purchase access, click on the title Starting From | Starting From ---|--- [Canadian enviroOSH Legislation](/products/legislation/legislationreg.html)| **$625.00** [Canadian en